legal_text = "[center][b][color=#FFD700]PanOptiRadar™ User Advisory and Strategic Liability Offset (SLO)[/color][/b][/center]

[i]Congratulations on activating the [b]PanOptiRadar™ Perceptual Expansion Module[/b] (\"The Device\").[/i]

By equipping, glancing at, or standing within the broader metaphysical range of The Device, you acknowledge that:

[quote]\"Seeing more\" may expose you to realities, entities, and energetic frameworks not intended for mortal perception.[/quote]

[b][u]Functionality Notice:[/u][/b]
The PanOptiRadar™ leverages proprietary [color=#88C0D0]HyperSpatial Realignment™[/color] technology ([i]actually just a zoom-out effect[/i]) to grant you expanded situational awareness across wide distances, tactical scenarios, and optional existential crises.

[b][u]⚠️ Health and Cognitive Warnings:[/u][/b]
Use of The Device may result in one or more of the following:
• Temporary loss of scale perception  
• Unwelcome clarity  
• Spatial vertigo  
• Peripheral delusions  
• [b]Overexposure to unfiltered cosmic awareness[/b]  
• A vague but persistent sense that \"you weren't supposed to see that\"

[i]Long-term use has been theorized (but never confirmed nor studied) to cause:[/i]  
• Retinal soul fatigue  
• Perceptual burnout  
• Mindstream desync  

[b][u]🛡️ Recommended Protective Pairing:[/u][/b]
For maximum pseudo-safety, The Device [i]should[/i] be used in tandem with the [b]Radiation Shield™[/b], which may or may not protect against:
• 5G-based mind triangulation  
• Reptilian thought-bleeds  
• Microwave sighs from above

Together, they create a [color=#A3BE8C][b]Unified Illusion of Safety™[/b][/color].

[b][u]🧾 Liability Statement:[/u][/b]
The Device is not intended to diagnose, treat, or interpret anything. All outcomes — including tactical enlightenment, emotional collapse, or seeing too much — are the sole responsibility of the user.

Use of the PanOptiRadar™ implies:
• Irrevocable consent to be observed while observing  
• Agreement that [i]\"zooming out is a lifestyle choice,\"[/i] not a right  
• Waiver of all claims real or imagined

[center][b][color=#BF616A]Zoom responsibly.™[/color][/b][/center]"
